tests/instructions/model/LowercaseForce.md:1:9:suggestion:WritingInstructions.LowercaseForce:§2: 'should' is outside the force vocabulary. If it states obligation, permission, or preference, write the force word (MUST, NEVER, SHOULD, MAY, PREFER X OVER Y). If it does not, leave it.
tests/instructions/model/LowercaseForce.md:7:1:suggestion:WritingInstructions.LowercaseForce:§2: 'Prefer' is outside the force vocabulary. If it states obligation, permission, or preference, write the force word (MUST, NEVER, SHOULD, MAY, PREFER X OVER Y). If it does not, leave it.
